// frame has been created and no old RenderFrameHost exists. This method, in combination
// with |FrameDeleted|, is appropriate for observers wishing to track the set of
// RenderFrameHosts that are current in their frame tree. Note that being current in a
// frame tree is separate from the lifecycle state of the RenderFrameHosts. Consider
// using |RenderFrameHostStateChanged|.
